        "filing_date": "2025-09-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To efficiently acquire customers, we rely on marketing in close cooperation with value-based selling to acquire new small, medium and large geographically-dispersed enterprises.",
